{"id":"en_omg-the-real-heiress-is-faking-crazy","title":"OMG! The Real Heiress Is Faking Crazy!","titleEn":"OMG! The Real Heiress Is Faking Crazy!","description":"Anna has left the asylum behind, only to find a different kind of madness waiting for her at home. Everyone adores the enemy she faces, and any attempt to reveal the truth only makes her look like the liar. So she keeps her knowledge to herself and plays the obedient daughter, smiling while her adopted sister takes over her life piece by piece. Those around her believe they have finally subdued her, but they are mistaken. The real Anna is only now starting to make her moves. The story is adapted from Shi Tu Jiu Jiu's short story \"Jia Qian Jin Shi Xi Jing, Dan Wo Shi Shen Jing A,\" published on Fanqie Novel. Viewers can follow the series and its episodes on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/omg-the-real-heiress-is-faking-crazy/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/omg-the-real-heiress-is-faking-crazy/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Counterattack","Pseudo Siblings","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det9u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_omg-the-real-heiress-is-faking-crazy_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det9u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_omg-the-real-heiress-is-faking-crazy_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det9u/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_omg-the-real-heiress-is-faking-crazy_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7det9